{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3002_019min", "source_sha256": "2839e8229681402f00351d15ebcdbf60a75c2fafe5f5b576a2e29d6954668439", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ちょうどいいところに！\n実は、収録中に作る一品のことで悩んでて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你来得正好！\n其实，我很烦恼该在节目上做哪一道菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3003_019min", "source_sha256": "184fddd7d45f0513bc776650116f437c741c6c01806dc7ee59c09c45931a42fa", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nどっちを作ったら、いいと思います？", "zh": "{$P$}先生\n觉得我要做哪一道会比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3004_p", "source_sha256": "f80959d7c8316a6ba992bc28b43c1e3e62b0c9f953ced4e44581d16e06d10774", "ja": "そうだなぁ、美奈子が作るなら……", "zh": "这个嘛……既然是美奈子要做的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3005", "source_sha256": "ee9e6bc5eac00e34f0f9cdbf4f5a4139f862c334779b8ab5e0700fa31c6dbd87", "ja": "やっぱりチャーハン！", "zh": "果然还是炒饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3006", "source_sha256": "755c4e446e3a76c09f8feeda05392a51ad2ad71708f58349542c8f9ff536f158", "ja": "特製肉まん！", "zh": "特制肉包！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3200_p", "source_sha256": "f0ae2aa4f47f48f1746b1480ec4ec87385462a8ed99c9483e2a5e56058df1230", "ja": "やっぱりチャーハンだな！　大きな鍋を振るのは、絵に\nなるし……画面からも、美奈子の元気が伝わりそうだ。", "zh": "果然还是炒饭吧！翻动大锅子的样子很吸引人……\n而且画面应该也能传达出美奈子有活力的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3201_019min", "source_sha256": "afa8e4ea9b6ae58e831563fb1c5a4231b14bb1a3cbe73d59caba259bdc0dfa42", "ja": "わっほ～い！　本当ですか？\nえへへ、なんか照れちゃうな……♪", "zh": "哇哦──！真的吗？\n嘿嘿，总觉得有点害羞呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3202_019min", "source_sha256": "1b95063538f0908275104183b3747838eef7bf15b7816d0332f3e141e96530a3", "ja": "番組で作るお料理、終わったら食べていいそうです。\n{$P$}さん、ご馳走しちゃいますね♪", "zh": "在节目上做的料理，录完影之后好像可以吃。\n我会让{$P$}先生大饱口福喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3300_p", "source_sha256": "f0ae2aa4f47f48f1746b1480ec4ec87385462a8ed99c9483e2a5e56058df1230", "ja": "やっぱりチャーハンだな！　大きな鍋を振るのは、絵に\nなるし……画面からも、美奈子の元気が伝わりそうだ。", "zh": "果然还是炒饭吧！翻动大锅子的样子很吸引人……\n而且画面应该也能传达出美奈子有活力的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3301_019min", "source_sha256": "fee939771589699dd972cf609816676b8a7994304b97e98df023304433f9cb3c", "ja": "そうですか？　う～ん。いつも作ってるし、\nたまには違うものを、と思いましたけど……。", "zh": "是这样子吗？唔～那是我平常就在做的料理，\n原本想偶尔做点不一样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3302_019min", "source_sha256": "f76c8b73477ad8c7dd3b3959127093104140ef45dcf1d043fd95791d71ffd4c1", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんがそう言うなら、\n張りきっちゃおうかな？　えへへ♪", "zh": "不过，既然{$P$}先生都这么说了，\n那我就稍微拿出真本事好了，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3500_p", "source_sha256": "9ccc8a5aa4552f6fe9bde68c888d6176a8816113f385a442a8773209dca20ce2", "ja": "特製肉まんなんか、どうだろう？\nきっと、喜ばれるぞ。", "zh": "特制肉包之类的，你觉得如何？\n一定会让大家很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3501_019min", "source_sha256": "8dc66cfc2dc7e8ff1c6ed1d66adf1ce0726a7d66528d57fd9fc46aee9e73efc2", "ja": "おお～。確かに、一度にたくさん作れますもんね～！\n具も色々考えられるし……。", "zh": "哦哦～的确，而且也能一次做很多份呢～！\n也能在内馅多下点工夫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3502_019min", "source_sha256": "8c9e380b87c87e6fce64e70bdf44a5fb105143b2edd983a5295e3da06b458114", "ja": "よ～し！　佐竹飯店の特製肉まんで、\n審査員の人達を、お腹いっぱいにしちゃいますね！", "zh": "好～！我会用佐竹饭店的特制肉包，\n把评审们的肚子都填得饱饱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3503_019min", "source_sha256": "a21dac89ff7b4943c68906a19b922f23547b182794a47b7e5d3664d5db6f5f4e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、具は何がいいですか？\n今なら、リクエストに応えちゃいますよ！　えへっ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得内馅要包什么才好？\n现在先讲，我可以回应你的要求喔！欸嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3600_p", "source_sha256": "9ccc8a5aa4552f6fe9bde68c888d6176a8816113f385a442a8773209dca20ce2", "ja": "特製肉まんなんか、どうだろう？\nきっと、喜ばれるぞ。", "zh": "特制肉包之类的，你觉得如何？\n一定会让大家很开心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3601_019min", "source_sha256": "d1a24e021932dd0fd271d1022110e7f519aa08676c013febc0bd95186045f917", "ja": "肉まんかぁ、時間かかっちゃうんですよねぇ。\nでも、せっかくだから、挑戦してみようかな……？", "zh": "肉包啊～会很花时间呢～\n不过，难得有这个机会，就挑战看看好了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_019min_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_019min_3602_019min", "source_sha256": "81b2bf387afd76cd030ad226675e21a12f74b250a5567d028c4d7ae265166fc4", "ja": "たくさん作りますから、{$P$}さんも\n食べてくださいね！　ノルマひとり1個以上、ですよ♪", "zh": "我会做很多肉包的，也请{$P$}先生\n要吃喔！一个人起码要吃一个以上喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
